## Custom Animations (v4.1+)

```css
/* In your CSS with @theme */
@theme {
  --animate-fade-in: fadeIn 0.5s ease-in-out;
  --animate-slide-up: slideUp 0.3s ease-out;
}

@keyframes fadeIn {
  from { opacity: 0; }
  to { opacity: 1; }
}

@keyframes slideUp {
  from {
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(20px);
  }
  to {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
}
```

Usage:

```html
